# How to say what is written, for desktop-say. One rule a line:
#   pattern<TAB>how to say it
# The pattern is an extended regular expression, matched whatever the case. Lines
# starting with # are comments. Yours to add to: a name the voice gets wrong is one line.
ocp([0-9])0([0-9])	O C P \1 oh \2
\bidrac([0-9]+)	I drack \1
\bidrac\b	I drack
\bk9s\b	K nines
\bargo9s\b	Argo nines
\bkubectl\b	cube control
\bllm-wiki\b	L L M wiki
\boob\b	out of band
\bminio\b	min I O
\bgitops\b	git ops
\bHARICA\b	Harika
\bnvim\b	neo vim
\btmux\b	T mux
